test('Sludge Wave poisons targets in opponent then ally order',async()=>{const {b}=await act(fixture({move:'Sludge Wave',firstHp:300,secondHp:300,firstRule:'boomburst-sludge-source-v1'}),'sludgewave',false,true);assert.equal(b.p2.pokemon[0].status,'psn');assert.equal(b.p2.pokemon[1].status,'psn');assert.equal(b.p1.pokemon[1].status,'psn');assert.equal(b.p1.pokemon[0].status,'');const order=b.log.filter(l=>l.includes('|-status|')&&l.includes('|psn')).slice(0,3).map(l=>l.split('|')[2].slice(0,3));assert.deepEqual(order,['p2a','p2b','p1b']);});

